<section class="section"><div class="container submit-wrap"><div class="submit-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Dari komunitas</div><h2>Punya cerita yang bikin orang <span class="text-red">baru ngeh?</span></h2><p>Kirim horror story, riddle, urban legend, atau pengalaman aneh. Tim BARU NGEH akan review sebelum tayang. Nama boleh disamarkan.</p><p style="font-size:12px;color:#5f5c58">Prototype ini menyimpan submission di browser. Versi production akan masuk ke database dan dashboard admin.</p></div><form class="form" id="submitStory"><div class="field"><label>Judul</label><input name="title" required placeholder="Contoh: Telepon Jam 3 Pagi"></div><div class="field"><label>Kategori</label><select name="category"><option>Horror Riddle</option><option>Mystery</option><option>Psychological</option><option>Urban Legend</option><option>Detective</option><option>Paranormal</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Cerita</label><textarea name="story" required placeholder="Tulis cerita lo di sini..."></textarea></div><div class="field"><label>Nama / alias</label><input name="author" placeholder="Opsional"></div><button class="btn primary">Kirim ke BARU NGEH</button><p id="submitStatus" style="color:#9b9893;font-size:13px"></p></form></div></section>